                        <field name="dc_description">Printed by James King, and Abraham Bradley King, (stationer to the King's Most Excellent Majesty), printers to the Honourable House of Commons. -- At foot of title "with the respective dates of the grants, and the respective terms for which the same have been granted ; and the names of the persons for whose use any pension is granted in trust". --  Includes list of pensions on civil establishment "presented at Bar, 1st February 1793", and those ceased by death, expiration and other causes "presented by the honourable Mr Jocelyn, January 29th 1793" ; and the list of pensions on the military establishment, and those ceased by death, expiration and other causes, both "presented at Bar, January 31 1793". </field>
